d: AC1\n        text: All four requirements R2.1-R2.4 from srd029-comm are implemented in cmd/comm/main.go\n      - id: AC2\n        text: Differential test cases are added to cmd/comm/comm_test.go for each new requirement\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go build ./cmd/comm/ succeeds with no errors\n      - id: AC4\n        text: go test ./cmd/comm/ -count=1 passes (or skips gracefully if gcomm is not installed)\n      - id: AC5\n        text: Existing functionality from R1.x is not broken\n\n- index: 3\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/comm -- srd029 R3.1-R3.4\"\n  dependency: 2\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd029-comm.yaml (full SRD -- focus on requirement group R3)\n      - cmd/comm/main.go (existing implementation from prior tasks -- extend, do not rewrite)\n      - cmd/comm/comm_test.go (existing tests -- add new test cases)\n      - CLAUDE.md (project patterns, build instructions, differential testing)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/comm/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add functionality for srd029 requirements R3.1 through R3.4\n      - path: cmd/comm/comm_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases covering R3.1 through R3.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd029-comm requirement R3.1 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd029-comm requirement R3.2 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd029-comm requirement R3.3 as specified in the SRD\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd029-comm requirement R3.4 as specified in the SRD\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Extend the existing cmd/comm implementation. Do not rewrite or restructure existing code that already implements R1.x and R2.x.\n      - id: D2\n        text: Follow the differential testing pattern using pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests against the gcomm reference binary.\n     